{"id":"shelbani-wheat","name":{"en":"Shelbani Wheat","ja":"シェルバニ麦","sc":"谢尔巴尼麦","tc":"謝爾巴尼麥"},"desc":{"en":"Hardy wheat that can even grow in harsh environments. It is a valuable source of carbohydrates in arid regions. Its peculiar red color is said to have evolved as a way of warding off insects.","ja":"厳しい環境でも育つ逞しい麦。乾燥地帯においては貴重な炭水化物源となる。特徴である赤色の穂先は、害虫を避けるために独自の進化を遂げた結果だと言われる"},"level":1,"slots":2,"evalue":10,"wind":true,"earth":true,"effect":50,"kind":"Material","locations":[{"id":"solice-trade-camp","name":{"en":"Solice Trade Camp","ja":"孤島の交易キャンプ"},"parent":"baskes-region"},{"id":"fertile-sea-eastern-area","name":{"en":"Fertile Sea - Eastern Area","ja":"豊饒の海・東部"},"parent":"stellard-southern-archipelago"},{"id":"fertile-sea","name":{"en":"Fertile Sea","ja":"豊饒の海"},"parent":"stellard-southern-archipelago"}],"categories":[{"id":"grain","name":{"en":"(Grain)","ja":"（穀類）"},"icon":"category-grain"},{"id":"plant","name":{"en":"(Plant)","ja":"（植物類）"},"icon":"category-plant"}],"index":6,"enum":"ITEM_MAT_SHELBANI_WHEAT"}